# SP1 6.4.0 executor, instruction counts per operation (execute only, no proving), 2026-09-16, M4 Max.
# Probe guests built by sp1-build (Succinct toolchain rustc 1.94.0-dev) outside this repository; flock at b684b12; tiny-keccak patch-2.0.2-sp1-6.0.0; sha2 patch-sha2-0.10.9-sp1-6.0.0.
# Each figure is (instructions with n operations - instructions with 0) / n; a precompile call counts one instruction and its proving cost is not in the count.
# modes: 0 loop only; 1 flock-field F128 mul (portable path); 2 flock-field square; 3 4-bit windowed mul; 4 8-bit table build per multiplicand (n=1000); 5 8-bit table lookup per multiplier; 6 per-byte-position reduced table build (n=100); 7 per-byte-position lookup; 8 SHA-256 compression, patched; 9 Keccak-256 of 64 bytes, patched; sha-unpatched: SHA-256 compression, unpatched.
# A check mode asserted the windowed and table multipliers against flock-field on 1,000 random pairs, square against a*a, and the hash test vectors.

